<title>USA: World Bank approves $51 million loan for Peru.</title>
<headline>World Bank approves $51 million loan for Peru.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank on Thursday said it approved a $51 million loan to help finance a resource management and poverty alleviation project in Peru.</p>
<p>The project is designed to improve water and natural resource management in the seven most poverty-stricken districts of the Sierra  mountains, the Bank said.</p>
<p>By identifying, financing and implementing rural investments, the project will increase production on fertile lands, and help convert marginal and erosion-prone soils to productive use.</p>
</text>
